            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The unsymmetric PIII/PV cyclodiphosphazane framework [(S[double bond, length as m-dash])(H)P(μ-NtBu)2PNHtBu] (2) provides entry into the mixed chalgogenide dianion [(S)P(μ-NtBu)2P(Se)NtBu]2-, and unique insight into the mechanisms of cis/trans isomerism in phosph(iii)- and phosph(v)-azanes.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
